# "Testing: Board — Play test 11-16" (room/testing-rooms.ts): the 2026-11-16 play test's board items on one
# board, for the operator to check by hand on PPE. It opens in the AI's Declare Attackers step with its
# Boggart Brute (menace) attacking: block it with one Wall of Stone to see the under-block mark, add the
# second to clear it. The AI's graveyard holds cards to click and view outside priority. On the human's
# turn: drag Abzan Devotee (a drag moves it, a click with no drag opens its mana ring), cast Dragonologist
# (its chip draws art, it arrives summoning sick), and Betor, Kin to All's end-step chip draws art.
turn=2
activeplayer=ai
activephase=COMBAT_DECLARE_ATTACKERS
humanlife=20
ailife=20
humanhand=Dragonologist;Lightning Bolt
humanbattlefield=Wall of Stone;Wall of Stone;Abzan Devotee;Betor, Kin to All;Island;Island;Island;Plains;Swamp;Forest
humanlibrary=Opt;Shivan Dragon;Island;Island;Island;Island;Island;Island
humangraveyard=
aihand=
aibattlefield=Boggart Brute|Attacking;Mountain;Mountain
ailibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
aigraveyard=Runeclaw Bear;Lightning Bolt;Grizzly Bears
